../code/conceptPage.scroll

id topaz-studiohaze
name Topaz
creators STUDIO HAZE
tags pl
website https://topaz.ooo/
aka 토파즈
description Topaz is a statically checked programming language developed by STUDIO HAZE for typesetting and general software development. Its compiler is written in Topaz and emits Rust. The documented toolchain includes direct execution, native programs, and Web and Worker targets. Native executables are distributed for Windows, macOS, and Linux. The public repository publishes compiler release source. This is distinct from the 2021 Topaz language by m-schm.
fileExtensions tpz
writtenIn topaz-studiohaze rust
compilesTo rust

docs https://topaz.ooo/v5.21/en/docs/getting-started
reference https://topaz.ooo/v5.21/en/docs/introduction
reference https://topaz.ooo/v5.21/en/docs/toolchain/backends
reference https://topaz.ooo/v5.21/en/docs/project/history
reference https://topaz.ooo/v5.21/en/docs/install

githubRepo https://github.com/studiohaze/topaz

hasStaticTyping true
hasTypeInference true

example
 import std.io
 let topic = "Topaz basics"
 let minutes: int = 25
 io.writeLine("{topic}: {minutes} minutes")
